        </div>

        <p class="shop-pay">Pay over time for orders over $35.00 with <strong>shop</strong><span class="pay">Pay</span> <a href="#learn">Learn more</a></p>

        <ul class="benefits-list">
          <li>No more messy sink cleanup</li>
          <li>Built-in vacuum catches every hair</li>
          <li>Rechargeable and travel friendly</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="actions-row">
          <button class="btn btn-primary large">Add to cart</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary">Share</button>
        </div>
